  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); padding: 10px; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6000003814697px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다. </span></font></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6000003814697px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요. </span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><iframe id=\"v555c2GwjCGJWHdHG9FFxFS\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/v555c2GwjCGJWHdHG9FFxFS?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InY1NTVjMkd3akNHSldIZEhHOUZGeEZTIiwidGlkIjoiNzBjMDYxNmQtYTg2YS00NjcwLTk5YTctZjMxZDgxOWZiMmMyIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTg1NTExfQ.Uyz9lXkfoQgTdodFDm3hTAc-qJBUx30vlpHc7Hq7r8hjURnFmANAAy8AGVN9w_ltGJ9CukcCAu2-R2G1T8bVeQ&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>영상이 짤린다면 아래 주소 영상의 뒷부분도 있습니다.</p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"https://tv.naver.com/v/922959/list/79522\">https://tv.naver.com/v/922959/list/79522</a><br></p><p><br></p><p class=\"0\">제가 만드는 학습지에 아래와 같은 글을 첨부했습니다.</p><p class=\"0\"><br></p><p class=\"0\"><br></p><p class=\"0\"><br></p><p class=\"0\">[드라마 대사 속 별의 밝기]&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\">장면 설명 :&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">수호</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">류준열</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)는</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">&nbsp;미신을 맹신하는 보늬</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">황정음</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">가 안타까운 마음에 점집 투어를 다닌다</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; “</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">아무리 그렇게 미신에 빠져있어도</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">그게 얼마나 말이 안 되는 건지 알라구요</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">!”</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\">수호 <span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">: </span>애초에 고대인들이 만든 별자리라는 것은 환영에 가깝다는 사실 알고 계셨습니까<span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">? </span>제 별이 밝아서 <span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">6</span>월에 운수가 좋다고 하셨는데<span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">, </span><u><b>이 별</b></u>이 실제로는 어두운 별인데 지구와 가까워서 밝은 거라면 이 별은 밝은 별일까요<span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">, </span>어두운 별일까요<span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">? </span>운수가 좋은 걸까요<span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">, </span>나쁜 걸까요<span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\">점쟁이 <span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">: ...!!??</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\">질문 <span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">: </span>밑줄 친 대사에 나온 이 별은 밝다고 표현해야 할까<span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">, </span>어둡다고 표현해야 할까<span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">? </span>자신의 생각을 적어보세요<span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">.</span></p><p><br></p><p><u>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</u></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 770%; text-indent: -132.8pt; margin-left: 8em;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"text-indent: -30.6pt; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">수호 </span><span style=\"text-indent: -30.6pt; font-family: &quot;한컴 바겐세일 M&quot;; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">:</span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}